		lines = {
			"Windows: the size handle in the bottom right corner of a window now takes the drag itself on a window whose own clickable area stops short of that corner, such as the \001Dressing room\002. Before, a press on the handle went to the dressing room's Close button or through the window to the world behind, so after the first click of a session the dressing room could not be sized at all.",
