		lines = {
			"Nameplates: the \001Target mark\002 now stands out. It is a bright outline round your target's health bar and its level box, clear of the threat ring, with a soft glow in \001Target mark colour\002 that starts at the outline and moves out past the threat ring while that shows.",
			"Nameplates: the \001Arrows at your target\002 are about twice as tall as the health bar and edged in black. They now sit outside the quest mark, class icon, level box, raid marker, threat value and auras instead of on top of them, and still point in at the bar.",
			"Nameplates: the target mark is Flat UI's own frame and follows your target's nameplate every frame, above every other nameplate and their level boxes, and dims with the nameplate's own fade. A nameplate first shown in a fight now gets its mark at once instead of when the fight ends.",
			"Nameplates: new rows \001Soft glow round the mark\002 (on) and \001Arrow size\002 (100%, 50% to 200%) under \001Target and focus\002 on the \001Marks and icons\002 tab.",
